  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It is given that the matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is singular, so</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Above equation holds true if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Now,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
